# Local build artifacts — the CLI uploads the whole repo, and these three
# are ~1.2GB of regenerable output that chokes the throttled upload path.
# Remote builds regenerate all of them:
#   apps/web/.next   — Next rebuilds remotely (proven by the git-based web deploys)
#   packages/shared/dist — npm `prepare` script rebuilds it on remote install
#   apps/api/dist    — tsc -b creates it during the remote build
apps/web/.next
apps/api/dist
packages/shared/dist
